ding","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#ci-usage-pattern","content":"CI usage pattern"},"2208":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-6","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#practical-gating-policy","content":"Practical gating policy"},"2209":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-7","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#see-also","content":"See also"},"2210":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-8","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#run-evals","content":"This workflow is the day-to-day path for quality checks. If you haven't authored a suite yet — the `[tool.fastskill.eval]` table, prompts CSV, and checks TOML — start with Eval setup first; pass/fail behavior (especially the inert `should_trigger` column, choosing between `skill_invoked` and `trigger_expectation`, and what `required = false` does) is documented there."},"2211":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-9","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#run-evals","content":"`--output-dir` is required on every `eval run` invocation — there is no default output location. All examples below include it. Each run lands under `<output-dir>/<timestamp>/<agent>/` (a numeric suffix is appended if that timestamp directory already exists) — that per-agent directory, not `<output-dir>` itself, is what `--run-dir` expects below."},"2212":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-10","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#run-the-suite","content":"**Runs are isolated by default.** Each case executes in a per-case scratch workspace containing only the skill under test (`SKILL.md` beside `skill-project.toml`, named by `[metadata].id`), with user-level skill discovery suppressed where the backend supports it. The `isolation:` line in the output (and the `isolation` object in `summary.json`) reports what each run actually got; a failed case's workspace survives under `<run-dir>/workspaces/` for debugging. Pass `--no-isolation` to run in the project root against your machine's ambient environment — and expect trigger rates measured before isolation existed to re-baseline on the first isolated run."},"2213":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-11","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#run-the-suite","content":"Common focused runs:"},"2214":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-12","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#summarize-the-run","content":"Use this for release notes and quick stakeholder review."},"2215":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-13","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#re-score-without-re-running-agent","content":"Use this when scoring logic changed and you want consistency across previous runs."},"2216":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-14","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#practical-gating-policy","content":"Block merge if smoke tag fails"},"2217":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-15","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#practical-gating-policy","content":"Block release if full suite fails"},"2218":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-16","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#practical-gating-policy","content":"Keep per-tag pass-rate trends to detect slow quality drift"},"2219":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-17","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#see-also","content":"Eval setup"},"2220":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-18","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#see-also","content":"Cluster analysis"},"2221":{"id":"/evals-quality/run-evals-19","page_id":"/evals-quality/run-evals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/run-evals#see-also","content":"eval command"},"2222":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","type":"page","content":"Eval Setup","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Evaluate and optimize","Evaluations"],"tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/setup"},"2223":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-0","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup","content":"Author an eval suite: the [tool.fastskill.eval] manifest table, the prompts CSV, and the checks TOML schema."},"2224":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-1","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/setup#eval-setup","content":"Eval Setup"},"2225":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-2","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/setup#prerequisites","content":"Prerequisites"},"2226":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-3","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"1\\. The `[tool.fastskill.eval]` table"},"2227":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-4","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/setup#validate-the-config","content":"Validate the config"},"2228":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-5","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"2\\. The prompts CSV"},"2229":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-6","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/setup#3-checks-checkstoml-optional","content":"3\\. Checks: `checks.toml` (optional)"},"2230":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-7","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`skill_invoked`"},"2231":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-8","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"`trigger_expectation`"},"2232":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-9","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/setup#command_contains","content":"`command_contains`"},"2233":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-10","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/setup#file_exists","content":"`file_exists`"},"2234":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-11","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/setup#max_tool_calls-alias-max_command_count","content":"`max_tool_calls` (alias: `max_command_count`)"},"2235":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-12","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/setup#making-a-check-advisory-with-required","content":"Making a check advisory with `required`"},"2236":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-13","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/setup#how-a-cases-passfail-is-decided","content":"How a case's pass/fail is decided"},"2237":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-14","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/setup#4-validate-then-run-then-report","content":"4\\. Validate, then run, then report"},"2238":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-15","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/setup#setup-checklist","content":"Setup checklist"},"2239":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-16","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/evals-quality/setup#see-also","content":"See also"},"2240":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-17","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#eval-setup","content":"This page is the reference for **authoring** an eval suite: the config table in `skill-project.toml`, the prompts CSV a suite is made of, and the optional checks TOML that actually decides pass/fail. Work through it top to bottom once, then use Run evals for the day-to-day commands."},"2241":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-18","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#eval-setup","content":"For guided suite design, use the FastSkill skill.\nIts eval-authoring workflow\nand copyable invoice example are maintained and packaged in the skills repository."},"2242":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-19","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#prerequisites","content":"`skill-project.toml` exists (project root or skill directory — `fastskill` walks up the tree to find it)."},"2243":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-20","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#prerequisites","content":"`SKILL.md` exists alongside it if you're authoring a single skill's suite."},"2244":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-21","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#prerequisites","content":"For `fastskill eval run`: a supported agent CLI on `PATH`. Agent keys come from aikit-sdk: `aikit`, `claude`, `codex`, `cursor`, `gemini`, and `pi`. A key is accepted only when its CLI is detected on the current machine; a typo and an uninstalled agent both error with `RUNTIME_UNKNOWN_ID`. `fastskill eval validate --all` reports which keys are detected in *your* environment."},"2245":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-22","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#prerequisites","content":"Deterministic validation and scoring need no model credential. Target execution needs the\nselected runtime's authentication; native judges separately need their configured endpoint,\nmodel, and credential environment variable. Embedding configuration is unrelated."},"2246":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-23","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Add this table to `skill-project.toml`. Every path is resolved relative to the **skill project root** (the directory containing `skill-project.toml`) unless it's absolute."},"2247":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-24","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Field"},"2248":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-25","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Type"},"2249":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-26","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Required"},"2250":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-27","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Default"},"2251":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-28","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Meaning"},"2252":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-29","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`prompts`"},"2253":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-30","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"path"},"2254":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-31","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"**yes**"},"2255":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-32","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"—"},"2256":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-33","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Path to the prompts CSV."},"2257":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-34","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`checks`"},"2258":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-35","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"path"},"2259":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-36","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"no"},"2260":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-37","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"none"},"2261":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-38","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Path to the checks TOML. Even when omitted, `should_trigger` produces a per-case trigger expectation — see the callout below."},"2262":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-39","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`timeout_seconds`"},"2263":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-40","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"integer"},"2264":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-41","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"no"},"2265":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-42","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`900`"},"2266":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-43","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Per-case timeout passed to the agent run."},"2267":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-44","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`trials_per_case`"},"2268":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-45","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"integer"},"2269":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-46","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"no"},"2270":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-47","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`1`"},"2271":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-48","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Trials run per case; validated to `[1, 1000]` (`EVAL_INVALID_TRIALS_CONFIG` otherwise)."},"2272":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-49","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`parallel`"},"2273":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-50","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"integer"},"2274":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-51","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"no"},"2275":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-52","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"unset (CPU core count)"},"2276":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-53","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Max concurrent trials for one case."},"2277":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-54","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`pass_threshold`"},"2278":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-55","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"float"},"2279":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-56","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"no"},"2280":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-57","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`1.0`"},"2281":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-58","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Fraction of trials that must pass for a case to be marked passed; validated to `[0.0, 1.0]` (`EVAL_INVALID_THRESHOLD` otherwise)."},"2282":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-59","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`fail_on_missing_agent`"},"2283":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-60","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"bool"},"2284":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-61","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"no"},"2285":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-62","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"**`true`**"},"2286":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-63","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"If true, `eval run` and `eval validate --agent <key>` error with `EVAL_AGENT_UNAVAILABLE` when the chosen agent isn't installed."},"2287":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-64","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"**Defaults verified against source** (`crates/fastskill-core/src/core/manifest.rs::EvalConfigToml`): `timeout_seconds` defaults to **900**, and `fail_on_missing_agent` defaults to **true** — the CLI refuses to run against a missing agent unless you explicitly set it to `false`. Don't assume otherwise from older examples."},"2288":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-65","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"With no `checks` file configured, each case still receives the required skill-consultation expectation implied by `should_trigger`. A successful process exit alone is not enough. Add a checks file for further deterministic outcome or adherence evidence."},"2289":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-66","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#validate-the-config","content":"Real output against a working config (this one set `timeout_seconds = 120` and `fail_on_missing_agent = false`):"},"2290":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-67","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#validate-the-config","content":"(`parallel: 0` here just means \"unset\" in the table renderer — the runner still falls back to CPU core count.) A broken `checks.toml` fails validation immediately, e.g.:"},"2291":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-68","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#validate-the-config","content":"A prompts CSV missing a required column fails the same way:"},"2292":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-69","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"The suite loader (`aikit-evals::suite`) reads a header row with **required** columns `id`, `prompt`, `should_trigger`, plus optional `tags` and `workspace_subdir`."},"2293":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-70","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Column"},"2294":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-71","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Required"},"2295":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-72","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Meaning"},"2296":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-73","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`id`"},"2297":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-74","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"yes"},"2298":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-75","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Non-empty identifier per row. Used for `--case`, artifact folder names, and reports."},"2299":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-76","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`prompt`"},"2300":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-77","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"yes"},"2301":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-78","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Text sent to the agent. Use CSV quoting (`\"...\"`, doubled `\"\"` for an embedded quote) for commas or newlines."},"2302":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-79","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`should_trigger`"},"2303":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-80","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"yes"},"2304":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-81","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`true`/`1` (case-insensitive `true`) or anything else counts as `false`. It creates a required per-case skill-consultation expectation; see below."},"2305":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-82","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`tags`"},"2306":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-83","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"no"},"2307":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-84","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Comma-separated tags inside the cell (e.g. `\"smoke,basic\"`). Used by `eval run --tag <name>`."},"2308":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-85","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`workspace_subdir`"},"2309":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-86","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"no"},"2310":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-87","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Relative path that becomes the agent's working directory for the case. Under the default isolation it is created **inside the case's scratch workspace**, with fixture files copied in from the same path under the project root; under `--no-isolation` it resolves directly under the project root. Empty or omitted → workspace root."},"2311":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-88","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Empty lines are skipped."},"2312":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-89","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"**`should_trigger` affects pass/fail.** The engine creates an implicit required `skill_invoked` check for each case, with `expected` equal to the CSV value. An explicit `skill_invoked` check that applies to the case replaces the implicit one; `eval validate` rejects a contradictory polarity. Therefore `false` tests non-consultation and `true` tests consultation, subject to the selected backend's observability."},"2313":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-90","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"This is adherence/selection evidence, not outcome correctness. A structured `Skill` call is direct evidence; supported decoders may also recognize a tool input that references the staged skill-document path. The path proxy indicates consultation, not that the instructions were read or followed. Pair positive cases with outcome checks or judges."},"2314":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-91","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#3-checks-checkstoml-optional","content":"Point `checks` at a TOML file with one or more `[[check]]` tables, keyed by the required `name` field. There are exactly five check types (`aikit_evals::checks::CheckDefinition`):"},"2315":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-92","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#3-checks-checkstoml-optional","content":"**Checks score the canonical trace, never raw stdout.** Every check below matches against the run's `trace.jsonl` — the parsed, structured event stream. Raw stdout is deliberately excluded: with the `claude` agent it opens with a `system`/`project init` event listing **every skill installed in the environment**, which used to make any skill-name pattern pass vacuously. Assistant text still reaches the trace as message events, so matching on what the agent actually said continues to work."},"2316":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-93","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"The check you almost certainly want for \"did my skill fire?\"."},"2317":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-94","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"Field"},"2318":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-95","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"Type"},"2319":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-96","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"Required"},"2320":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-97","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"Default"},"2321":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-98","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`skill`"},"2322":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-99","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"string"},"2323":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-100","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"no"},"2324":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-101","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"— (omit to match *any* skill invocation)"},"2325":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-102","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`expected`"},"2326":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-103","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"bool"},"2327":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-104","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"no"},"2328":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-105","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`true` (`false` asserts the skill did **not** run)"},"2329":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-106","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`required`"},"2330":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-107","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"bool"},"2331":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-108","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"no"},"2332":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-109","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`true`"},"2333":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-110","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`cases`"},"2334":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-111","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"string array"},"2335":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-112","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"no"},"2336":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-113","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"all cases (exact case IDs)"},"2337":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-114","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"Matches a structured `Skill` invocation or, where the decoder supplies it, a tool input referring to the staged skill-document path. When `skill` is given, a structured invocation must exactly match its identifying field. A skill name merely mentioned in unrelated prose does not count. Path-reference matching improves portability but remains a consultation proxy rather than proof of adherence."},"2338":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-115","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"Every check type supports `cases = [\"case-id\", ...]`, selecting exact case IDs. An absent selector applies to every case. Use selectors for checks that should not run across a mixed suite."},"2339":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-116","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"Field"},"2340":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-117","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"Type"},"2341":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-118","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"Required"},"2342":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-119","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"Default"},"2343":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-120","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"`pattern`"},"2344":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-121","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"string"},"2345":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-122","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"yes"},"2346":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-123","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"—"},"2347":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-124","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"`expected`"},"2348":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-125","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"bool"},"2349":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-126","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#trigger_expectation","content":"yes"},"2350":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-127","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"t