naming","content":"**Scope** → First directory level (the publishing organization, e.g., \"acme\")"},"3038":{"id":"/registry/index-system-23","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"**ID** → Second directory level (the package name, must not contain slashes, e.g., \"web-scraper\")"},"3039":{"id":"/registry/index-system-24","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"Examples:"},"3040":{"id":"/registry/index-system-25","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"`acme/web-scraper` → `acme/web-scraper/` (scope: \"acme\", id: \"web-scraper\")"},"3041":{"id":"/registry/index-system-26","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"`myorg/analytics-tool` → `myorg/analytics-tool/` (scope: \"myorg\", id: \"analytics-tool\")"},"3042":{"id":"/registry/index-system-27","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"`john/personal-helper` → `john/personal-helper/` (scope: \"john\", id: \"personal-helper\")"},"3043":{"id":"/registry/index-system-28","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"This structure:"},"3044":{"id":"/registry/index-system-29","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"Groups skills by organization"},"3045":{"id":"/registry/index-system-30","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"Provides intuitive navigation"},"3046":{"id":"/registry/index-system-31","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"Scales well for most use cases"},"3047":{"id":"/registry/index-system-32","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"Simplifies directory management"},"3048":{"id":"/registry/index-system-33","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#version-metadata-format","content":"Each skill has a single file at `{scope}/{id}` containing newline-delimited JSON entries for all versions. The path is constructed from:"},"3049":{"id":"/registry/index-system-34","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#version-metadata-format","content":"`scope`: The publishing organization (e.g., \"acme\")"},"3050":{"id":"/registry/index-system-35","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#version-metadata-format","content":"`id`: The package name from `skill-project.toml` (must not contain slashes, e.g., \"web-scraper\")"},"3051":{"id":"/registry/index-system-36","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#version-metadata-format","content":"Each line is a compact `VersionEntry` JSON object:"},"3052":{"id":"/registry/index-system-37","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#field-descriptions","content":"**name**: Skill identifier"},"3053":{"id":"/registry/index-system-38","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#field-descriptions","content":"**vers**: Semantic version (e.g., \"1.2.3\")"},"3054":{"id":"/registry/index-system-39","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#field-descriptions","content":"**deps**: Dependencies (currently empty, reserved for future use)"},"3055":{"id":"/registry/index-system-40","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#field-